            "value": "%@选区"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applies generic profile strength when camera metadata is not available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相机元数据不可用时，应用通用配置文件强度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Auto balances the average color. Custom follows Temperature and Tint.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动会平衡平均颜色。自定义则依据色温和色调。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blend the chosen color into the edges while keeping the center unchanged": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将所选颜色融入边缘，同时保持中心不变"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a custom grid color": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择自定义网格颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose the vignette color": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择晕影颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chooses how strongly the calibration sliders below are applied. Version 6 is the current default.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "决定下方校准滑块的强度。版本 6 为当前默认值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clear Menu": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清除菜单"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click a pixel that should be neutral.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点按应为中性色的像素。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click a purple or green fringe to set its hue range.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点按紫色或绿色边缘以设定其色相范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click the picture to save a color. Up to eight colors.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点按图片以保存颜色。最多八种颜色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Color Picker (%@ Color)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取色器（%@颜色）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Color Picker (Text Color)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取色器（文字颜色）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Color for the added canvas": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新增画布的颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Color that fills transparent areas": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "填充透明区域的颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Crops empty edges after the transform and fits the result back into the frame.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "变换后裁掉空白边缘，并将结果重新适合到画面中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diffusion is soft and wide, Bloom is tighter, and Halation is a red fringe.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扩散柔和而宽广，泛光更集中，光晕则呈红色边缘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dims the picture outside this color's range. It is not kept when you press OK.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使此颜色范围之外的画面变暗。按下“好”后不会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag a color in the picture. Nearby color families move together.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在图片中拖动颜色。相邻的色系会一起移动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag inside the wheel. Angle sets hue, distance sets saturation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在色轮内拖动。角度决定色相，距离决定饱和度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag or scroll to move around; double-click switches between Fit and 100%": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖动或滚动以移动视图；双击可在“适合”与 100% 之间切换"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag to set hue and saturation. Double-click to reset this wheel.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖动以设定色相和饱和度。双击可重置此色轮。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Draw two or more lines on the preview that should be level or vertical.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在预览上绘制两条或更多应保持水平或垂直的线。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "End of the hue range, in degrees.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色相范围的结束角度（度）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grid Settings…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网格设置…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HSL lists every color. Color edits one family. Point Color adjusts a color you pick.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HSL 列出所有颜色。“颜色”用于编辑某一个色系。“点颜色”调整你选取的颜色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlight Priority protects bright edges. Color Priority also reduces color. Paint Overlay covers the edges evenly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高光优先保护明亮边缘。颜色优先还会降低色彩。绘制叠加则均匀覆盖边缘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far a color may be from the picked ones and still be selected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "颜色距离所选颜色多远仍会被选中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue and saturation of this wheel.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此色轮的色相和饱和度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue shifts the color, Saturation its strength, and Luminance its brightness.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色相改变颜色，饱和度改变强度，明度改变明暗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Input and output of the selected curve point.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选曲线点的输入和输出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lock aspect ratio. Hold Shift while dragging a handle to turn it the other way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "锁定宽高比。拖动手柄时按住 Shift 可反转锁定状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off leaves the picture as it is. Guided straightens from lines you draw on the picture.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭会保持画面不变。参考线会根据你在画面上绘制的线进行校正。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Recent": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最近使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Parametric lifts tonal regions. Point places anchors on the curve.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "参数会调整各个影调区域。点会在曲线上放置锚点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Perspective allows stronger keystone. Rectilinear keeps the warp gentler.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "透视允许更强的梯形校正。直线投影则使变形更平缓。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Protect bright areas near the edge": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保护边缘附近的明亮区域"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pulls red and blue fringes apart toward the center to reduce color edging.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将红色和蓝色边缘向中心拉开，以减少色边。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "RGB changes brightness. Red, green, and blue also shift the color.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RGB 改变亮度。红、绿、蓝还会改变颜色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Red, green, and blue of the pixel under the pointer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指针所指像素的红、绿、蓝数值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove every guide line.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移除所有参考线。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Replaces this curve with a straight line or a contrast curve.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将此曲线替换为直线或对比度曲线。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select everything except those colors, such as all but a green screen": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择这些颜色之外的所有内容，例如除绿幕以外的全部"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select layer mask; Option-click to view it alone; Shift-click to enable/disable; Cmd-click to select its black areas (Cmd-Shift adds, Cmd-Option subtracts)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择图层蒙版；按住 Option 点击可单独查看；按住 Shift 点击可启用或停用；按住 Command 点击可选择黑色区域（Command-Shift 添加，Command-Option 减去）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select layers by clicking the canvas. Hold Command to turn it the other way while you click.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点按画布选择图层。按住 Command 点按可反向选择。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select this picked color.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择此已拾取的颜色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show the image again (or Option-click the mask thumbnail)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新显示图像（或按住 Option 点按蒙版缩览图）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show the whole image (⌘0)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示整个图像（⌘0）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start of the hue range, in degrees.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "色相范围的起始角度（度）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The brush trails the pointer on a string this long, so a shaky hand still draws a smooth line": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画笔会以这样长度的“绳”跟随指针，因此手抖也能画出平滑的线条"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The height of each line of characters": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每行字符的高度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three-Way shows shadows, midtones, and highlights. The other choices show one wheel.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "三向显示阴影、中间调和高光。其他选项只显示一个色轮。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ungroup Layers": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取消图层编组"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop viewing the mask": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停止查看蒙版"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add layer mask (Option-click for a black mask)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加图层蒙版（按住 Option 点击可添加黑色蒙版）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add layer mask revealing the selection (Option-click to hide it)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加显示选区的图层蒙版（按住 Option 点击可改为隐藏选区）"
          }
        }
      }
