    "%lld more tabs": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还有 %lld 个标签页"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Several layers are selected. Select just one to paint on it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已选择多个图层。请只选择一个图层再绘画。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is a folder, which has no pixels of its own. Paint on a layer inside it, or on the folder’s mask.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”是文件夹，本身没有像素。请在其内部的图层上绘画，或在该文件夹的蒙版上绘画。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is hidden, or inside a hidden folder. Show it to paint on it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”已隐藏，或位于已隐藏的文件夹中。请先显示它再绘画。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The layer mask is turned off. Shift-click its thumbnail to turn it on, then paint.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图层蒙版已停用。按住 Shift 点击其缩览图启用后即可绘画。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is an adjustment layer, with no pixels to paint. Paint on its mask instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”是调整图层，没有可绘画的像素。请改为在其蒙版上绘画。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing is selected, so there’s nowhere to paint. Choose Select › Deselect (⌘D) to paint anywhere.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前没有选区，因此无处可绘画。请选择“选择”›“取消选择”（⌘D）后随处绘画。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Smudge and Liquify work on a layer's pixels, not its mask.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "涂抹和液化作用于图层的像素，而不是其蒙版。"
