    "Darker or lighter before the lines are drawn": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "绘制线条前先调暗或调亮画面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Draw no line where the picture is darker than this, leaving the screen dark": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画面暗于此处时不画线，让屏幕保持暗色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Break the lines into beads where the picture is darker than this, blending into solid lines where it's brighter": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画面暗于此处时线条断成点状，越亮越连成实线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the gap a bright line fills; dimmer parts draw it thinner": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "亮线填充间隙的程度；越暗的地方线条越细"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the brightness is smoothed before it displaces the lines, from sharp ridges to rounded hills": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "位移线条前对亮度做多大范围的平滑，从锐利的脊线到圆缓的丘陵"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lift the lines where the picture is bright, or lower them when negative, so they swell into its shapes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按画面亮度抬升线条，取负值时则下压，让线条随画面形状起伏"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright the lines are where the picture is black, so they show even over black": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画面为黑处线条的亮度，让它在纯黑上仍然可见"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move the red and blue apart, for colored fringes on the lines": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分离红色与蓝色，在线条上形成彩色边缘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose the screen's color": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择屏幕颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose the lines' color": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择线条颜色"
          }
        }
      }
