          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沿分离方向把颜色涂抹成条痕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Linear splits along one direction; Radial splits outwards from a center, sharp there": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "线性：沿一个方向分离；径向：从中心向外分离，中心保持锐利"
