            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拆分为图层"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Split the layer's original channels into four grayscale layers, Red, Green, Blue and Alpha, for Export As › Channel Pack. Color under fully transparent pixels can't be recovered": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把图层的原始通道拆成四个灰度图层（红、绿、蓝、Alpha），供「导出为 › 通道包」使用。完全透明像素下方的颜色无法恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pen pressure sets the size: a light touch paints a thinner line": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "压感控制粗细：落笔越轻线条越细"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pen pressure sets the opacity: a light touch paints fainter, up to the brush’s Opacity": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "压感控制不透明度：落笔越轻颜色越淡，上限为画笔的不透明度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pressure for size": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "压感控制粗细"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pressure for opacity": {
