    "How far the streaks reach across the picture": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光条在画面中延伸多远"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright a light has to be to flare": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光线要多亮才会产生光晕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the lens's coatings turn each streak blue along its length; none keeps the light's own color": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "镜头镀膜让每条光晕沿其长度变蓝的程度；为零时保留光线原本的颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the spikes reach": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "星芒尖角延伸多远"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright a light has to be to sparkle": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光线要多亮才会产生星芒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many spikes each light has, as the lens's aperture blades make them": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个光源的尖角数量，由镜头光圈叶片决定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much light scatters: a soft halo around bright areas, and gently lifted shadows": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光线散射的程度：亮部周围形成柔和光晕，暗部被轻轻提亮"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the light spreads": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光线扩散多远"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many times the picture echoes, each fainter": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画面重影的次数，每层更淡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far apart the copies are": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各重影之间的距离"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far out of focus: the size of each disc": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "失焦程度：每个光斑的大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How brightly lights open into discs": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光源散开成光斑的亮度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Light gathered at each disc's rim, as some lenses draw it": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光斑边缘聚集的光，某些镜头的成像特征"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The aperture's shape: round wide open, a hexagon of blades, an anamorphic oval, or a cat's eye toward the edges": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光圈形状：全开时为圆形，收小后呈叶片构成的六边形，变形镜头为椭圆，画面边缘为猫眼形"
          }
        }
      }
    },
