            "value": "重影只出现在画面一侧，或向两侧同时延伸"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright a light has to be to flare; near 100, only the biggest, brightest spots": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光线要多亮才会产生光晕；接近 100 时只保留最大最亮的光源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How bright a light has to be to sparkle; near 100, only the biggest, brightest spots": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光线要多亮才会产生星芒；接近 100 时只保留最大最亮的光源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This project uses format version %lld. This app supports versions 1–%lld and 27.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此项目使用的格式版本为 %lld。本 App 支持版本 1–%lld 和 27。"
